DESCRIPTION:Frameline & Another Planet Entertainment present\nA Tribute to
  Dolly Parton\n9 to 5\nFeaturing a drag performance by Peaches Christ\n\nS
 unday\, October 11 | The Castro\n\nWe can’t stay inside a lonely room an
 d cry forever\, so dry those tears and join Frameline (a few doors) down a
 t The Castro Theatre for a very special evening celebrating the life\, tal
 ents\, and values of the truly one-of-a-kind Dolly Parton. First\, Peaches
  Christ will pay tribute to the beloved “Jolene” singer with a drag ho
 mage\, and then we’ll start laughin' and drinkin' and havin' a party wit
 h a screening of 9 to 5.\n\nDirected by Colin Higgins (Harold and Maude)\,
  this cult classic centers on three women — the exuberant Doralee (Dolly
  Parton)\, the timid Judy (Jane Fonda)\, and the sharp-witted Violet (Lily
  Tomlin) — as they toil away at Consolidated Companies under the misogyn
 istic Mr. Hart (Dabney Coleman). When talking trash and sharing their wild
 est revenge fantasies isn’t enough\, the trio get even with their bigot 
 of a boss.\n\nWhether you love the film for its titular working-class anth
 em\, its satirical screwball comedy that skewers sexism in the workplace\,
  or the iconic trio at its center\, 9 to 5 is undeniably one of the late D
 olly Parton’s many great gifts to popular culture.\n\nA percentage of al
 l proceeds from ticket sales will be donated to Dolly Parton’s Imaginati
 on Library in honor of its founder.\n\nLuminary and Visionary Director Mem
 bers receive special access to this screening. Please log into your accoun
 t to...\n\n$25-$26\, All ages\nFrameline & Another Planet Entertainment pr
 esent: A Tribute to Dolly Parton\, Featuring Peaches Christ\nListed time i
 s doors\n\nTickets: https://www.frameline.org/films/frameline50/9-to-5\nDe
 tails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/11/9-to-5-featuring-a-drag-perf
 ormance-by-peaches-christ-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
