CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Nothing will ever diminish the power of THE TEXAS CHAIN SAW MA
 SSACRE. Shot through a cinéma vérité lens\, director Tobe Hooper's fero
 cious classic follows five friends that fall victim to the grotesque Leath
 erface and his cannibalistic family. With a beautifully raw DIY aesthetic 
 and powerful performances\, this shockingly realistic film revolutionized 
 the horror landscape when it was unleashed on a politically and socially t
 umultuous America in 1974. Facing controversy and censorship throughout it
 s troubled release\, THE TEXAS CHAIN SAW MASSACRE has stood the test of ti
 me to become a landmark film and cultural milestone.\n\nTickets: https://d
 rafthouse.com/sf/show/the-texas-chainsaw-massacre-1974?cinemaId=0802&sessi
 onId=21340\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/12/the-texas-chai
 n-saw-massacre-1974-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
