  a blanket and warm clothes.\nLeashed and crowd-friendly dogs are welcome.
 \nParking is very limited. We recommend walking\, biking\, or taking publi
 c transportation.\nBring low-profile chairs only. Tall chairs must stay on
  the edges — don’t block someone else’s view!\n\nABOUT THE SAN FRANC
 ISCO STANDARD:\nThe San Francisco Standard is the Bay Area’s fastest gro
